# Responsibility: Reconcile coordinator bookkeeping with authoritative MoveIt state.
# The caller must first
# quiesce manipulation tasks and every legacy scene writer. This operation reads
# MoveIt, invalidates every lease/quarantine/idempotency record and starts a new
# coordinator session. It never changes MoveIt's PlanningScene.
string expected_session_id
uint64 expected_revision

# Must be true. The explicit acknowledgement prevents an accidental state reset
# from a generic service client or stale recovery request.
bool accept_authoritative_state

# Quarantine protects resource keys whose physical disposition became
# uncertain when their lease expired. Accepting MoveIt's scene does not by
# itself prove the robot/object state, so clearing quarantine requires this
# separate typed operator/recovery acknowledgement.
uint8 PRESERVE_QUARANTINE=0
uint8 ACCEPT_QUARANTINED_RESOURCES=1
uint8 quarantine_resolution

# Exact semantic set copied from the latest coordinator state. Order is
# ignored, but every key must be canonical and unique. Recovery is rejected if
# the quarantine changed before the atomic session rebase. Keep this empty for
# PRESERVE_QUARANTINE.
string[] expected_quarantined_resource_keys
---
string new_session_id
PlanningSceneOperationResult result
